SUMMARY:Yolks on You! Burlesque and Variety Brunch
LOCATION:The Comedy Loft of DC\, 1523 22nd St NW\, Washington
DESCRIPTION:Yolks on You! is a burlesque and variety matinee hosted by Ring
 ling Bros. and Barnum & Bailey alum Jim Dandy and award-winning burlesque p
 erformer Delilah Dentata. Every few months\, they fill the bill with the fu
 nniest\, strangest performers they can find. Over the years that’s meant 
 burlesque\, clown\, live music\, flow arts\, drag\, mime\, pole\, puppets\,
  and a few things we still don’t know how to describe.\n\nYolks started a
 s a brunch show in January 2018 and became DC’s longest-running burlesque
  and variety brunch. Join the party.\n\nPlease note\, there is a 2 item per
  person minimum in the showroom. This can be any combination of food items 
 or beverages. This does NOT include items bought in the basement at the Bie
 r Baron Tavern.\n\nAll General Admission seating is first come first serve\
 , therefore we cannot guarantee seating together. Groups need to be particu
 larly aware of this. We recommend arriving at least 30 minutes to an hour p
 rior to show time for better seat selection.\n\nDoors close 30 minutes afte
 r showtime.\n\nTickets are available at the door UNLESS tickets have sold o
 ut.\n\nGuests must be 18+for entry. Those under the age of 21 will be given
